			"notes": "# ARprod's Delight 4.2.0: Refreshing Refurbish\n\nThis is a small one, but fixes some important stuff.\n\n## Additions\n- Refreshing Mob Effect\n  - Removes negative effects periodically and grants saturation for each effect removed\n- Banana Milkshake\n  - Grants Refreshing\n- Sweet Berries Ice Cream\n## Fixes and Changes\n- Fixed Caffeine not being reset on sleeping causing Coffee to be unusable after reaching the limit\n- Fixed crash with Coffee Addict advancement caused by 4.1 advancement location changes\n- Lactose intolerance is now removed upon waking up\n- Chewing gum now grants Refreshing\n- Removed Apple Crate in favour of [Crate Delight](https://modrinth.com/mod/crate-delight)"
